## Abstracts

Abstracts are what you need to quickly design your interfaces. They are premade views that provide a musical functionality such as a synth controller, a tuner, a metronome... They can be interconnected quickly.

In more technical terms, Abstracts are high-level views, that are super specialised into a specific purpose, and as such often complex. For example, the synth view is specialised into controlling a synth, and is composed by lower level views which all dedicate to a particular subtask.

