### Slider

A slider. See Graphical Module : GMFaderSlider.

#### Methods

- `~gmWidgets.getSlider;`

- `min(Number minValue)`

- `max(Number maxValue)`

- `scale(Symbol/Number scale` `\lin`, `\exp`, `\log` or a Number representing a curvature value

- `setValue(Number value)`

#### Signals

- `\_valueChanged { Number newValue }`

#### Template

```
var slider, sliderAction;

sliderAction = { |value|
	value.postln;
};
slider = ~gmWidgets.getSlider
.min(220)
.max(440)
.scale(\exp)
.setValue(330)
.connectSignal(
	\_valueChanged,
	sliderAction
);
```

