## Tools

Tools are mid-level views that are used by Abstracts or other Tools, and specialised to a specific task. They're not supposed to be instantiated manually unless you're designing your own Abstract. The best example is the Param Manager : it is the subpart of the Synth View which is responsible for creating a view for each parameter of the synth. Each type of param (discrete, continuous, tempo related, ...) also has his own Tool. In turn, those Tools are mostly composed with Widgets.

